---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="WIZ Bangka Belitung - Tebarkan Kebaikan"
    description="Wahdah Inspirasi Zakat (WIZ) Bangka Belitung - Lembaga Amil Zakat Terpercaya. Melayani Zakat, Infak, Sedekah & Wakaf untuk pemberdayaan umat di Bangka Belitung."
    image="/assets/images/foto-utama-wiz.jpg"
>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative pt-xxl pb-xxl px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-xl items-center">
            <div class="space-y-6 z-10">
                <h1 class="font-display-lg-mobile text-display-lg-mobile md:font-display-lg md:text-display-lg text-primary font-bold leading-tight">Tebarkan Kebaikan, Hadirkan Kebermanfaatan</h1>
                <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Bersama Wahdah Inspirasi Zakat Bangka Belitung, wujudkan kepedulian melalui Zakat, Infak, dan Sedekah untuk membangun masyarakat yang lebih berdaya.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
                    <a href="/donasi" class="bg-[#F7941D] text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-level-1 hover:shadow-level-2 hover:opacity-95 transition-all font-label-md text-label-md font-bold flex items-center gap-xs">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">volunteer_activism</span>
                        <span>Donasi Sekarang</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/program" class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary px-8 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-level-1 hover:shadow-level-2 hover:bg-primary transition-all font-label-md text-label-md font-bold flex items-center gap-xs">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">grid_view</span>
                        <span>Lihat Program</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="relative h-[400px] md:h-[500px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-level-2 border border-surface-variant">
                <img id="main-hero-img" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105" data-site-img="hero_card" data-alt="Relawan WIZ Bangka Belitung" src="/assets/images/foto-utama-wiz.jpg" onerror="this.src='/assets/images/sedekah-beras-dhuafa.jpg';" alt="Relawan WIZ Bangka Belitung Menyerahkan Sedekah Beras"/>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section: Tentang Kami, Legalitas, Visi & Misi WIZ -->
    <section id="tentang-kami" class="py-xxl bg-surface border-t border-b border-outline-variant/20">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter space-y-xl">
            
            <!-- Section Header -->
            <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-xs">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs font-label-md text-label-md text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">info</span>
                    Tentang Kami
                </span>
                <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Wahdah Inspirasi Zakat (WIZ) Bangka Belitung</h2>
                <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Lembaga Amil Zakat Nasional yang Amanah, Profesional, dan Berkelanjutan.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Content Grid: Profil Lengkap & Visi Misi -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-xl items-start">
                
                <!-- Left Column: Profil & Legalitas Formal (7 Cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-surface-container-lowest p-xl rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-level-1 space-y-md">
                    <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">verified_user</span>
                        <span>Profil &amp; Legal Formal Kelembagaan</span>
                    </h3>
                    
                    <div class="space-y-md text-on-surface-variant font-body-md leading-relaxed text-justify">
                        <p>
                            <strong>Wahdah Inspirasi Zakat (WIZ)</strong> merupakan Lembaga Amil Zakat Nasional (LAZNAS) yang berfokus pada pengelolaan dana zakat, infak, sedekah (ZIS), serta dana kemanusiaan. WIZ berkomitmen menghadirkan program-program pemberdayaan umat yang berorientasi pada kemaslahatan dan keberlanjutan yang mencakup bidang dakwah, pendidikan, ekonomi, kesehatan, dan sosial kemanusiaan.
                        </p>

                        <!-- Legal Badge Box -->
                        <div class="p-md bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-xl space-y-1 text-emerald-950 font-label-md text-caption">
                            <p class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1 text-emerald-900 text-sm">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-primary">gavel</span>
                                Pengakuan Legal Formal LAZNAS:
                            </p>
                            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 font-medium text-emerald-800">
                                <li>SK Kementerian Agama Republik Indonesia <strong>Nomor 1209 Tahun 2024</strong> (LAZNAS)</li>
                                <li>SK Kantor Wilayah Kementerian Agama Prov. Kep. Bangka Belitung <strong>Nomor 290 Tahun 2023</strong></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <p>
                            Dengan dukungan jaringan relawan, dai, dan mitra di berbagai wilayah Indonesia, WIZ terus berupaya menghadirkan manfaat nyata bagi masyarakat melalui berbagai program sosial, pendidikan, dakwah, dan kemanusiaan yang tepat sasaran dan berkelanjutan.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Sebelumnya, Wahdah Inspirasi Zakat dikenal dengan nama <strong>LAZIS Wahdah Islamiyah</strong> yang telah menjalankan aktivitas pengelolaan dan penyaluran zakat sejak tahun 2002. Pengalaman tersebut menjadi fondasi penting dalam meningkatkan kualitas pelayanan, penghimpunan, dan pengelolaan dana umat secara amanah, profesional, dan transparan.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Dengan landasan syariat Islam serta tata kelola kelembagaan yang baik, Wahdah Inspirasi Zakat berkomitmen menjalankan perannya sebagai lembaga amil zakat nasional yang amanah, profesional, dan berorientasi pada kebermanfaatan umat.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Column: Visi & Misi WIZ (5 Cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-md">
                    <!-- Visi Card -->
                    <div class="bg-primary text-on-primary p-xl rounded-2xl shadow-level-1 space-y-xs">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary-fixed">visibility</span>
                            <span class="font-caption text-caption font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-fixed">VISI WIZ</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-white leading-snug">
                            Menjadi Lembaga Amil Zakat Nasional Yang Amanah Dan Profesional.
                        </h3>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Misi Card -->
                    <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-xl rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-level-1 space-y-md">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30 pb-xs">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">target</span>
                            <span class="font-caption text-caption font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">MISI WIZ</span>
                        </div>

                        <ul class="space-y-md font-body-md text-on-surface">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-sm">
                                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs mt-0.5">1</span>
                                <span class="font-medium text-on-surface-variant">Meningkatkan Kesadaran Ummat Tentang Urgensi Menunaikan Ibadah Zakat.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-sm">
                                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs mt-0.5">2</span>
                                <span class="font-medium text-on-surface-variant">Meningkatkan Penghimpunan dan Pendayagunaan Dana Zakat, Infaq dan Sedekah Secara Profesional, Transparan, Tepat Guna dan Tepat Sasaran.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-sm">
                                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs mt-0.5">3</span>
                                <span class="font-medium text-on-surface-variant">Memaksimalkan Kualitas Pelayanan Berbasis Kerja Yang Solutif, Praktis Dan Aplikatif.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-sm">
                                <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs mt-0.5">4</span>
                                <span class="font-medium text-on-surface-variant">Memaksimalkan Peran Lembaga Dalam Bidang Sosial, Dakwah dan Kemandirian Ummat.</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Program Preview Section (5 Berkah WIZ) -->
    <section class="py-xxl px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter bg-surface-container-low">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto space-y-xl">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-sm">
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs bg-primary-container/10 text-primary-container px-md py-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-caption font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">stars</span>
                    Program Unggulan WIZ
                </span>
                <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">5 Berkah WIZ Bangka Belitung</h2>
                <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Pilar program penyaluran zakat, infak, dan sedekah tepat sasaran untuk masyarakat Babel.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter" id="home-featured-programs-grid">
                <!-- Program Preview Card 1 -->
                <article data-title="Sedekah Beras Dhuafa" class="program-card bg-surface rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-level-1 hover:shadow-level-2 transition-all border border-surface-variant flex flex-col">
                    <div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden">
                        <img class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105" src="/assets/images/sedekah-beras-dhuafa.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/assets/images/sedekah-beras-dai.jpg';" alt="Sedekah Beras Dhuafa"/>
                        <span class="absolute top-sm left-sm bg-primary text-on-primary font-caption text-caption px-sm py-xs rounded-full font-semibold">Sosial</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-lg flex flex-col flex-grow">
                        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface mb-xs">Sedekah Beras &amp; Sembako Dhuafa</h3>
                        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-md flex-grow line-clamp-2">Bantuan kebutuhan pokok untuk lansia dan keluarga pra-sejahtera.</p>
                        <div class="mb-lg space-y-xs">
                            <div class="flex justify-between font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant">
                                <span>Terkumpul: <strong>Rp 0</strong></span>
                                <span class="font-semibold text-primary">0%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-surface-variant rounded-full h-2">
                                <div class="bg-primary h-2 rounded-full" style="width: 0%"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="openDonationModal('Sedekah Beras &amp; Sembako Dhuafa')" class="w-full bg-[#F7941D] text-white font-label-md text-label-md py-sm rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity font-bold cursor-pointer">Donasi Sekarang</button>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Program Preview Card 2 -->
                <article data-title="Beasiswa Tahfidz Qur'an" class="program-card bg-surface rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-level-1 hover:shadow-level-2 transition-all border border-surface-variant flex flex-col">
                    <div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden">
                        <img class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105" src="/assets/images/beasiswa-tahfidz.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/assets/images/beasiswa-tahfidz.jpg';" alt="Beasiswa Tahfidz"/>
                        <span class="absolute top-sm left-sm bg-primary text-on-primary font-caption text-caption px-sm py-xs rounded-full font-semibold">Pendidikan</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-lg flex flex-col flex-grow">
                        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface mb-xs">Beasiswa Tahfidz Qur'an</h3>
                        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-md flex-grow line-clamp-2">Beasiswa pendidikan penuh dan asrama bagi santri penghafal Al-Qur'an yatim dhuafa.</p>
                        <div class="mb-lg space-y-xs">
                            <div class="flex justify-between font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant">
                                <span>Terkumpul: <strong>Rp 0</strong></span>
                                <span class="font-semibold text-primary">0%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-surface-variant rounded-full h-2">
                                <div class="bg-tertiary-container h-2 rounded-full" style="width: 0%"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="openDonationModal('Beasiswa Tahfidz Qur\'an')" class="w-full bg-[#F7941D] text-white font-label-md text-label-md py-sm rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity font-bold cursor-pointer">Donasi Sekarang</button>
                    </div>
                </article>

                <!-- Program Preview Card 3 -->
                <article data-title="Beasiswa Pendidikan Juara" class="program-card bg-surface rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-level-1 hover:shadow-level-2 transition-all border border-surface-variant flex flex-col">
                    <div class="relative aspect-video overflow-hidden">
                        <img class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105" src="/assets/images/beasiswa-pendidikan-juara.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='/assets/images/default-program-wiz.jpg';" alt="Beasiswa Pendidikan"/>
                        <span class="absolute top-sm left-sm bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary font-caption text-caption px-sm py-xs rounded-full font-semibold">Pendidikan</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-lg flex flex-col flex-grow">
                        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface mb-xs">Beasiswa Pendidikan Juara</h3>
                        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-md flex-grow line-clamp-2">Bantuan biaya sekolah dan kelengkapan perlengkapan belajar.</p>
                        <div class="mb-lg space-y-xs">
                            <div class="flex justify-between font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant">
                                <span>Terkumpul: <strong>Rp 0</strong></span>
                                <span class="font-semibold text-primary">0%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-surface-variant rounded-full h-2">
                                <div class="bg-tertiary-container h-2 rounded-full" style="width: 0%"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="openDonationModal('Beasiswa Pendidikan Juara')" class="w-full bg-[#F7941D] text-white font-label-md text-label-md py-sm rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity font-bold cursor-pointer">Donasi Sekarang</button>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center">
                <a href="/program" class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs bg-primary text-on-primary px-xxl py-md rounded-lg font-label-md text-label-md font-bold hover:bg-primary-container transition-all shadow-level-1">
                    <span>Lihat Semua Program Kebaikan</span>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Visualisasi Dinamis: Distribusi Infak Umum Berbasis Wilayah -->
    <section id="distribusi-infak-umum" class="py-xxl px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter bg-surface border-t border-b border-surface-variant/40">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto space-y-xl">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-md">
                <div class="space-y-xs max-w-2xl">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-primary/10 text-primary px-md py-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-caption font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">pie_chart</span>
                        Alokasi Otomatis &amp; Transparansi 100%
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Distribusi Dinamis 'Infak Umum' Berbasis Wilayah</h2>
                    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Setiap rupiah dari donasi <strong>Infak Umum</strong> otomatis dipecah dan didistribusikan ke 5 Pilar program WIZ sesuai persentase kebutuhan cabang operasional.</p>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Wilayah Switcher Tabs -->
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 shrink-0">
                    <button type="button" onclick="switchInfakUmumWilayah('Pangkalpinang', this)" class="infak-tab-btn active px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition-all bg-primary text-white shadow-xs">Pangkalpinang</button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="switchInfakUmumWilayah('Sungailiat', this)" class="infak-tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition-all text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary">Sungailiat</button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="switchInfakUmumWilayah('Semua', this)" class="infak-tab-btn px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition-all text-on-surface-variant hover:text-primary">Semua Wilayah</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Grid Container: Donut Chart + Pillars Breakdown -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-xl items-center bg-surface-container-lowest p-lg md:p-xl rounded-3xl border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-level-1">
                
                <!-- Left Column: Interactive SVG Donut Chart & Simulator -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-6">
                    <div id="home-infak-chart-container" class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-full min-h-[220px]">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Live Nominal Simulator -->
                    <div class="w-full bg-surface-container-low p-4 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 space-y-2">
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-on-surface flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-primary">calculate</span> Simulasikan Nominal Infak Anda:</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-outline font-semibold">Simulasi Real-Time</span>
                        </label>
                        <div class="relative">
                            <span class="absolute left-3 top-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-outline">Rp</span>
                            <input type="number" id="home-sim-amount" value="100000" min="10000" step="10000" oninput="handleHomeSimulationChange(this.value)"
                                class="w-full pl-9 pr-3 py-2 text-sm font-bold font-mono text-primary bg-white border border-outline-variant/50 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-primary">
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-1.5 pt-1">
                            <button type="button" onclick="setHomeSimAmount(50000)" class="flex-1 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold rounded-lg bg-white border border-outline-variant/40 hover:border-primary text-on-surface-variant transition-colors cursor-pointer">50rb</button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="setHomeSimAmount(100000)" class="flex-1 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold rounded-lg bg-white border border-outline-variant/40 hover:border-primary text-on-surface-variant transition-colors cursor-pointer">100rb</button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="setHomeSimAmount(250000)" class="flex-1 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold rounded-lg bg-white border border-outline-variant/40 hover:border-primary text-on-surface-variant transition-colors cursor-pointer">250rb</button>
                            <button type="button" onclick="setHomeSimAmount(500000)" class="flex-1 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold rounded-lg bg-white border border-outline-variant/40 hover:border-primary text-on-surface-variant transition-colors cursor-pointer">500rb</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <a id="home-infak-cta-btn" href="/donasi?type=Infak%20Umum&wilayah=Pangkalpinang" class="w-full bg-[#F7941D] hover:opacity-95 text-white py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl font-label-md text-label-md font-bold text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm transition-transform hover:scale-[1.01]">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">volunteer_activism</span>
                        <span>Salurkan Infak Umum (Pangkalpinang)</span>
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Column: 5 Pillars Detailed Breakdown List -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-3" id="home-infak-pillars-container">
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Live Social Proof: Donatur Terbaru & Terverifikasi Real-Time -->
    <section id="donatur-terbaru" class="py-xxl px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter bg-surface border-t border-b border-surface-variant/40">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto space-y-lg">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-end gap-md">
                <div>
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 px-md py-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-caption font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-xs">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 animate-pulse"></span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-emerald-700">verified</span>
                        Donasi Terverifikasi Real-Time
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Donatur Terbaru &amp; Sahabat Kebaikan</h2>
                    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant">Jejak kepedulian para muhsinin yang telah terverifikasi dan siap disalurkan ke program-program WIZ.</p>
                </div>
                <a href="/laporan" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-primary hover:text-primary-container font-label-md text-caption font-bold transition-colors">
                    <span>Lihat Laporan Transparansi Lengkap</span>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div id="verified-donors-container" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-md">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Kalkulator Zakat Quick Tool -->
    <section id="kalkulator-zakat" class="py-xxl px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter bg-surface">
        <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto bg-surface-container-low rounded-2xl p-xl md:p-xxl border border-surface-variant shadow-level-1">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-xl items-center">
                <div class="space-y-md">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary px-md py-xs rounded-full font-label-md text-caption font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">calculate</span>
                        Hitung Zakat
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface">Kalkulator Zakat Maal &amp; Penghasilan</h2>
                    <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                        Hitung kewajiban zakat Anda secara akurat sesuai kaidah fiqih. Masukkan jumlah penghasilan atau tabungan bulanan Anda.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-surface p-lg rounded-xl border border-surface-variant space-y-md shadow-sm">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold text-on-surface mb-xs">Total Penghasilan / Tabungan (Rp)</label>
